---
import { MonitorSmartphone, MapPin, CircleCheck } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="atendimento" class="py-24 bg-brand-light relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 gsap-reveal">
      <span class="text-brand-green font-medium tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-4 block">Formatos</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-brand-greenDark mb-6">
        Como funciona o atendimento
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-textMuted">
        As sessões duram em média 50 minutos a 1 hora e ocorrem semanalmente. Ofereço um ambiente seguro e acolhedor, seja na modalidade presencial ou online.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Online -->
      <div class="gsap-reveal bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-soft border border-brand-beige hover:border-brand-green/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-green/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-brand-greenDark">
          <MonitorSmartphone class="w-8 h-8" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-brand-greenDark mb-4">Terapia Online</h3>
        <p class="text-brand-textMuted mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Atendimento para qualquer lugar do mundo. Flexibilidade de horários e o conforto de realizar a sessão do seu próprio ambiente seguro, através de plataforma de vídeo segura e sigilosa.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-center text-brand-text font-medium">
            <CircleCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mr-3" /> Sem deslocamento
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-brand-text font-medium">
            <CircleCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mr-3" /> Maior flexibilidade
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-brand-text font-medium">
            <CircleCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mr-3" /> Sigilo garantido
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://wa.me/5549991069172?text=Olá,%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20consulta%20ONLINE." target="_blank" class="block w-full py-4 text-center rounded-xl bg-brand-light text-brand-greenDark font-medium hover:bg-brand-green hover:text-white transition-colors border border-brand-green/20">
          Agendar Online
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Presencial -->
      <div class="gsap-reveal delay-1 bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-soft border border-brand-beige hover:border-brand-green/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-green/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-brand-greenDark">
          <MapPin class="w-8 h-8" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-brand-greenDark mb-4">Terapia Presencial</h3>
        <p class="text-brand-textMuted mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Atendimento presencial em Água Doce - SC. Um consultório cuidadosamente preparado para te receber com conforto, privacidade e total acolhimento.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-center text-brand-text font-medium">
            <CircleCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mr-3" /> Ambiente acolhedor
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-brand-text font-medium">
            <CircleCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mr-3" /> Contato humano direto
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center text-brand-text font-medium">
            <CircleCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-green mr-3" /> Localização acessível
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://wa.me/5549991069172?text=Olá,%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20consulta%20PRESENCIAL%20em%20Água%20Doce." target="_blank" class="block w-full py-4 text-center rounded-xl bg-brand-greenDark text-white font-medium hover:bg-brand-green transition-colors shadow-md">
          Agendar Presencial
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
